Z||000000||Haze_Performance||03-08-2001||11:17 PM||||After seeing JBGehling's post of all his Fiero's I was thinking of all the cars Ive owned...<P>My List:<P>First Car.... 1979 Fiat X19. Green w/Black interior.<BR>              1977 Ford LTD. 2-Door Black & White. w/Gray interior.<BR>              1979 Mercury Cougar XR7. Med Red w/Gray interior.<BR>              1973 Buick Centry. Green w/Gray interior.<BR>              1971 Buick LeSabre. Forest Green w/Black Leather. (MINT)<BR>              1990 Chevy IROC. White w/Gray interior. (T-Tops)<BR>              1994 Hyundai Excel. Green w/Gray interior. 4000 watt Audio System..I was into a little overkill back then.. HEHE   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> (My first new car)<BR>              1990 Dodge Shadow. Gold w/Tan interior. 1100 watt Audio System. I calmed down a little after the Excel.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>              1986 Mustang LX Coupe. 5.0L Blue w/Black interior (ex Illinois DEA Police Car).<BR>              1988 Mustang LX Convert. 5.0L Black w/Red interior.<BR>              1992 Mustang GT Convert. 5.0L Black w/Black Leather.<BR>              1985 Fiero Sport Coupe. Silver w/Gray interior.<BR>              1987 Fiero SE. Gold w/Tan interior.<P>Coming soon: 1993 Mustang LX Coupe. 5.0L Red w/Black interior.<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">   </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery (Updated Weekly)</A><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 03-08-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||RossT||03-08-2001||11:24 PM||||1. 1964 Pontiac Catalina<BR>2. 1962 VW bug<BR>3. 1977 Chevy Vega (no joke,best car I had)<BR>4. 1986 Chevy s10 blazer<BR>5. 1988 VW Jetta GTI 16V<BR>6. 1968 Plymouth Cuda<BR>7. 1968 Dodge Charger<BR>8. 1992 Dode Carvan<BR>9. 1988 Pontiac Fierogt 700miles<BR>10. 1988 pontiac Fierogt 1000 miles t-top<BR>11. 2000 Dodge Grand Caravan<BR>12. 1985 Chevy K-10 4X4<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 03-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Oreif||03-08-2001||11:49 PM||||1969 Pontiac Catalina<BR>1976 Pontiac Astre<BR>1979 Pontiac Grand Prix<BR>1985 Pontiac Grand Am<BR>1986 Pontiac Fiero SE<BR>1990 Geo Storm<BR>1994 GMC Jimmy<BR>1984 Oldsmobile Ninety Eight<BR>1986 Pontiac Fiero SE  *<BR>1994 Saturn<BR>1998 Dodge Durango *<BR>1995 Dodge Intrepid *  (For Sale!)<BR>2001 Mitsubushi Galant *<P>(* are ones I own now)<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Haze_Performance||03-08-2001||11:54 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>1969 Pontiac Catalina<BR>1976 Pontiac Astre<BR>1979 Pontiac Grand Prix<BR>1985 Pontiac Grand Am<BR>1986 Pontiac Fiero SE<BR>1990 Geo Storm<BR>1994 GMC Jimmy<BR>1984 Oldsmobile Ninety Eight<BR>1986 Pontiac Fiero SE  * (For Sale!)<BR>1994 Saturn<BR>1998 Dodge Durango *<BR>1995 Dodge Intrepid *  <BR>2001 Mitsubushi Galant *<P>(* are ones I own now)<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>How much for the Fiero?? HeHe..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>I have a good 1969 Pontiac Catalina story. My Dad owned one in the 80's. It was Gold with Tanish interior. He was driving home from work. (He worked in a bad neighborhood)As he was driving along some guy pulled up next to him and started yelling & pointing. My Dad said the guy wasnt making sense so he sped up. Well about 2 blocks later the guy caught up and started again. The light turned red and the guy started yelling "You Fu**ing idiot your cars on fire!!!" My dad jumped out and saw flames shooting out from under the car. As soon as he walked away from it the car exploded.. There was a hole in the hood as big as a basketball. I remember when the tow truck brought the car home... The entire dash was melted. (Along with the HUGH hole in the hood)<P>-----------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ttttttt.gif">   </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>PFF Members Photo Page</A><BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1431213" TARGET=_blank><BR>Photopoint Gallery (Updated Weekly)</A><p>[This message has been edited by Haze_Performance (edited 03-09-2001).]||||reg||4
Z||000004||Hank is Here||03-09-2001||12:29 AM||||My cars in order<P>1)1988 Chevy Celebrity<BR>2)1952 M38A1 Jeep<BR>3)1952 M38A1 Jeep <BR>4)1966 CJ5 Jeep<BR>6)1964 CJ6 Jeep<BR>7)1988 Fiero Coupe<BR>8)1979 CJ7 Jeep<BR>9)1987 Fiero GT<BR>10)1984 Fiero Coupe<P>Two wierd things:<BR>A) I still own all of these cars<BR>B)I am only 21 and have 10 cars<P>I also own two trailers, I did have three but actually sold one.<BR>||||reg||1
